{"title":"2025 IOQM/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span id=\"Problem_Statement_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.B6.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.A8.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.A3.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_Statement_പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The height and the base radius of a closed right circular cylinder are positive integers and its total surface area is numerically equal to its volume. If its volume is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/4/da40faccb9c89ca9cfed0f44129b44b014b42639.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\pi$\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is a positive integer, what is the smallest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p>ഒരു അടഞ്ഞ വലത് വൃത്താകാര സിലിണ്ടറിന്റെ ഉയരവും അടിസ്ഥാന ആരവും ധനപൂർണ്ണസംഖ്യകളാണ്. അതിന്റെ ആകെ ഉപരിതല വിസ്തീർണ്ണം സംഖ്യാത്മകമായി അതിന്റെ വ്യാപ്തത്തിന് തുല്യമാണ്. അതിന്റെ വ്യാപ്തം <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/4/da40faccb9c89ca9cfed0f44129b44b014b42639.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\pi$\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" /> ആണെങ്കിൽ, ഇവിടെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> ഒരു ധനപൂർണ്ണസംഖ്യയാണ്. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />-യുടെ സാധ്യമായ ഏറ്റവും ചെറിയ മൂല്യം എന്താണ്?\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B9.E0.B4.BE.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_പരിഹാരം\">Solution പരിഹാരം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution പരിഹാരം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The surface area of a cone is equal to twice the area of one of its circular base plus the area of the rectangle formed by the circumference times the height. That is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/3/a6359e7c800dd5e4f23f6061fddd8f9da6b9d54d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2r^2\\pi + 2\\pi r^2 h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" />. The volume is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/2/b224160938f468ac287eb6fefb56d09bf7511474.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi r^2 h$\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />. So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/7/7771b472decd7846344a30be50910e4ae3433355.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2r^2\\pi + 2\\pi r h = \\pi r^2 h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"161\" height=\"18\" />. Divide by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> to obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/7/807dd9f15a4003295f743eb773286545eac5f564.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2r \\pi + 2\\pi h = \\pi r h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"16\" />. Divide by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2ca003a7da0de4994b4733e203b74ff52d42553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" /> and obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/f/19fb08dac04c931e7c22e104e075ff39243089d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2r + 2h = rh$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />. Obviously, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f5c33e7ea0201c92357a43617d98af46022e6f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r,h \\in \\mathbb{Z}^+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"20\" />. We have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/7/c27ea1321df617c9ac80af1894f2394493065b57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = rh-2r-2h \\implies (r-2)(h-2) = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"329\" height=\"20\" /> Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/0/35025d53f9b59c076cf3c0f5c962a8f371d7907a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=h= 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" /> works, and so does <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/2/a82c10e165698ae854696f2cfd1129976330c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=3,h=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" /> or vice versa, and so the volume is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/e/90ece706bfac0d52db1121379401a4b03557b46d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/8/a785e4d8bf17e63399d421f6cafafbee7b44e78f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{54}\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"42\" height=\"25\" />, and we are done.\n</p><p>ഒരു കോണിന്റെ ഉപരിതല വിസ്തീർണ്ണം അതിന്റെ ഒരു വൃത്താകാര അടിസ്ഥാനത്തിന്റെ വിസ്തീർണ്ണത്തിന്റെ ഇരട്ടിയും, ചുറ്റളവ് × ഉയരം ഉപയോഗിച്ച് രൂപപ്പെടുന്ന ദീർഘചതുരത്തിന്റെ വിസ്തീർണ്ണവും ചേർന്നതിന് തുല്യമാണ്. അതായത്, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/3/a6359e7c800dd5e4f23f6061fddd8f9da6b9d54d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2r^2\\pi + 2\\pi r^2 h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>വ്യാപ്തം <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/2/b224160938f468ac287eb6fefb56d09bf7511474.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi r^2 h$\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" /> ആണ്. അതിനാൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/7/7771b472decd7846344a30be50910e4ae3433355.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2r^2\\pi + 2\\pi r h = \\pi r^2 h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"161\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> കൊണ്ട് ഹരിച്ചാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/4/da4533330dbb3afad4e6a08914345a048244223c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2r\\pi + 2\\pi h = \\pi rh$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"16\" /> ലഭിക്കുന്നു.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2ca003a7da0de4994b4733e203b74ff52d42553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" /> കൊണ്ട് ഹരിച്ചാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/f/19fb08dac04c931e7c22e104e075ff39243089d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2r + 2h = rh$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" /> ലഭിക്കുന്നു.\n</p><p>വ്യക്തമായും, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f5c33e7ea0201c92357a43617d98af46022e6f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r,h \\in \\mathbb{Z}^+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"20\" /> ആണ്.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/7/c27ea1321df617c9ac80af1894f2394493065b57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = rh-2r-2h \\implies (r-2)(h-2) = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"329\" height=\"20\" /> എന്ന് നമുക്കുണ്ട്.\n</p><p>അതിനാൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/5/df5d266570e13f9a43431a5f0d03e41935661122.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=h=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" /> സാധുവാണ്. അതുപോലെ തന്നെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/2/a82c10e165698ae854696f2cfd1129976330c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=3,h=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" /> അല്ലെങ്കിൽ തിരിച്ചും സാധുവാണ്. അതിനാൽ വ്യാപ്തം <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/e/90ece706bfac0d52db1121379401a4b03557b46d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" /> അല്ലെങ്കിൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/8/a785e4d8bf17e63399d421f6cafafbee7b44e78f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{54}\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"42\" height=\"25\" /> ആണ്, അങ്ങനെ നാം പൂർത്തിയാക്കി.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018070616\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 113/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5661/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37886:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018070616 and revision id 292624. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}